1
00:00:00,174 --> 00:00:02,174
Hi. Christy.

2
00:00:02,343 --> 00:00:03,973
- Hey, Leonard.
- I'm Sheldon.

3
00:00:04,137 --> 00:00:06,347
(Christie:)Right. You're Howard's entourage.

4
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:10,770
So, Christy, what are your plans?

5
00:00:10,935 --> 00:00:14,355
(Christie:)Well, Howard said he'd take me shopping
in Beverly Hills.

6
00:00:14,522 --> 00:00:18,232
(Penny:)Yeah, no, I meant plans to find
someplace to live other than with me.

7
00:00:18,401 --> 00:00:21,361
(Penny:)Not that I don't love having you,
but it's a little crowded.

8
00:00:21,529 --> 00:00:23,609
(Leonard:)Penny, you're always welcome
to stay with us.

9
00:00:23,781 --> 00:00:26,821
(Sheldon:)Oh, terrific.
Now we're running a cute little B & B.

10
00:00:27,618 --> 00:00:29,458
Let me offer a little thinking here.

11
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:32,750
- Why doesn't Christy stay with me?
- You live with your mother.

12
00:00:32,915 --> 00:00:35,585
(Howard:)I do not. My mother lives with me.

13
00:00:36,586 --> 00:00:40,296
It's settled. Christy will stay with Howard,
Penny can go back to her apartment.

14
00:00:40,465 --> 00:00:42,885
(Sheldon:)And I'll watch the last 24 minutes
of Doctor Who...

15
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:46,140
(Sheldon:)...although at this point,
it's more like Doctor Why Bother?

16
00:00:47,263 --> 00:00:50,853
- Sheldon, you just can't dictate...
- No more talking. Everybody go.

17
00:00:51,851 --> 00:00:55,441
So, what do you say?
Wanna repair to Casa Wolowitz?

18
00:00:55,605 --> 00:00:58,145
(Christie:)What is that, like a Mexican deli?

